    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Barcelona-born graphic designer, illustrator, type designer and art director (Elisava grad), founded her own independent studio in 2008 after winning ADC Young Guns. Highly senior, around 17 years running her own practice: AGI member, TDC board member 2023-2024, two published books (Type to Image, 2022; Sobreviure al disseny, Anagrama 2025), clients spanning Nike, Spotify, NYT, Vogue, Coca-Cola, Wieden+Kennedy. Sources place her between Barcelona and an Amsterdam period (Behance profile and a 2020 interview say Amsterdam; TDC bio and the 2025 Catalan book point back to Barcelona), so Country is a hedge, flagged as an open question. Reads as top-end autonomy, runs and directs her own projects unsupervised.",
